class: positive
summary: a field may be named `at`: after another field's type, an `at` that a `:` or `,` follows is the next field's name, and one that an offset follows is that field's clause
constructs: 0750, 1795
program: program.ldn
targets: linux-x86-64, linux-arm64, darwin-arm64, freebsd-x86-64, freebsd-arm64, linux-rv64
